		(property "Note" "Per-port RJ45-VCC polyfuse (owner ruling 2026-07-15): fault isolation -- a shorted patch cable or failed module trips ONE port instead of browning out the shared 5VSB system (the TPS2121 limit is total, not per-port). 0805 PTC, 500mA hold, 6V rated. ~150mV drop at load absorbed by module LDO headroom."
