		(property "Description" "Hardware persist/shutdown trigger for loss of the final selected +5VSB rail, upstream of D1 and the parallel C1+C37 9400uF hold-up reservoir. IN+=BLACKOUT_SENSE, IN-=COMP_THRESH (~1.59V; ~4.36V nominal selected-rail trip), OUT=PWR_FAIL_INT -> ESP32 IO14. This trigger precedes buck dropout; TPS3839 remains the final reset backstop."
